<p style="color:var(--tx2);margin-bottom:12px">The kitchen’s idea is simple: fresh ingredients, patient cooking and generous portions. Gravies simmer for hours, breads come straight from the tandoor, and every plate is finished by hand.</p>
<p style="color:var(--tx2)">The dining room is warm, quiet and made for long dinners with family and friends.</p></div>
